  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A ball of flame burns your scalp to the bone, almost boiling your brain inside the skull.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Unconscious] from heat shock. If successful, instead gain @Condition[Fatigued] (2). You also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} and will never regrow your head hair, suffering a penalty of -10 to your Fellowship whenever the exposed bone of your skull becomes obvious.</p>"
    },
